      "post_subject": "First time TEA",
      "content_md": "Depends of what you want.\n\nIf you want a color shift, don't rinse it.\n\nIf you want only a increase in sensitivity only, rinse it.",
      "signature": "",
      "attachments": [],
      "quotes": [],
      "is_first_post": false,
      "url": "https://holographyforum.org/forum/viewtopic.php?p=40545#p40545"
