      "post_date": "Sat Jul 30, 2005 6:19 am",
      "post_datetime": "2005-07-30T11:19:00+00:00",
      "post_subject": "First time TEA",
      "content_md": "But if you only want to increase sensitivity and not shift color, you must rinse it and wash out the tea BEFORE exposure. if you wash it out after exposure but before developing, there will be a color shift, too.",
